From: Anton Argirov <anton.argirov@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 18:00:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(mmc): respond to CMD13

Handle SEND_STATUS through the SD SPI command parser so firmware can
query a present card after initialization.

---
diff --git a/src/storage/mmc.c b/src/storage/mmc.c
--- a/src/storage/mmc.c
+++ b/src/storage/mmc.c
@@ -177,7 +177,7 @@
 
 static int tsconf_mmc_init_command(z80_byte command)
 {
-    return command==0x77 || command==0x69 || command==0x50;
+    return command==0x77 || command==0x69 || command==0x50 || command==0x4d;
 }
 
 
